  "goodToKnow": "Erahnen means to sense, guess or just make out something not fully visible: Umrisse erahnen, das Ausmaß erahnen. It's a bit literary. The root ahnen means to suspect or sense: Ich ahnte nichts Gutes. Die Ahnung is a hunch: Keine Ahnung! (no idea), one of the most common German phrases. Die Ahnen (plural) are ancestors. Not separable: hat erahnt."
